dd 1B87 1B88 1B89 1B8A 1B8B 1B8C 1B8D 1B8E 1B8F 1B90 1B91 1B92
dd 1B93 1B94 1B95 1B96 1B97 1B98 1B99 1B9A 1B9B 1B9C 1B9D 1B9E
dd 1B9F 1BA0 1BA1 1BA2 1BA3 1BA4 1BA5 1BA6 1BA7 1BA8 1BA9 1BAA
dd 1BAB 1BAC 1BAD 1BAF 1BB0 1BB1 1BB2 1BB3 1BB4 1BB5 1BB6 1BB7
